ns in various therapeutic areas, including cancers of blood, liver, kidney, lung, brain, breast, and ovary; and APIs in various categories, such as oncology, central nervous system, pain management, and cardiovascular care. It also provides orthopedic products comprising bisphosphonates, which are oral and injectable drugs; and gastroenterology products consisting of novel drugs for chronic hepatitis-B and hepatitis-C, as well as contract manufacturing services. In addition, the company offers neurology, cardiology and diabetology products for the treatment of hypertension, stable angina, and CHF. Further, the company provides agro chemicals and biological pest management solutions for management of insects, fungicides, herbicides, diseases, and weeds across a range of crops. NATCO Pharma Limited was incorporated in 1981 and is headquartered in Hyderabad, India.","employees":4433,"earnDates":[1802340000],"exDiv":1795046400,"asOf":1795452725},"analyst":{"key":"buy","mean":2.36364,"n":9,"tMean":1002.1111,"tHigh":1240,"tLow":712,"tMed":1058,"currency":"INR","asOf":1795452725,"trend":{"strongBuy":3,"buy":4,"hold":2,"sell":2,"strongSell":0}},"cap":"Small","caFix":null,"fetched":1795452724,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"NATCO Pharma\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Natco Pharma formulation unit issued 7 observations by U.S. FDA","s":"The Hindu","d":1795447477,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxQTlFBd3hBWTBIaF9JOTFNWkE1Y3lIbDhKV2RXQ0h4RHd5WHBNd0tFSm1LM2twb0xiOVdhMWpmMXFZd2U0RHlXcFJJS1Y2VkVDTExySWFBU01SZHFzdXZROHk4ei1IUjF2Z2pmWWV0R1BSQnVuMTY2cHEzNVgtVlhYOENNRmtvbTN4aVhsNXJKMzBuQUdYU203ZTdYbWRwcVVEakc0Qk1yTmtpWGlvMGwtQ09PY3NhZUdSRWg0MENlZXZaQQ?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"NATCO Pharma's Hyderabad Plant Gets 7 Observations in USFDA Inspection","s":"Medical Dialogues","d":1795444575,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"U.S. FDA Issues 7 Observations After Inspection Of Natco Pharma’s Hyde